<%- include('partials/header') -%>

        <!-- Policy Content Section -->
        <section class=" py-40 lg:py-40">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6">
                <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold">Refund & Return Policy</h1>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-bg-card p-8 rounded-lg shadow-xl mb-12" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-accent-brown mb-4">No Returns on Frozen Food Products</h2>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                            At Nanshhuf, your safety and satisfaction come first. Because frozen food requires strict temperature control and hygiene standards, we unfortunately cannot accept returns or provide refunds once products have been delivered. This policy helps us maintain the highest quality and food safety for every customer.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-6">Why We Have This Policy</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-brown flex-shrink-0 mt-1"></i>
                                <div class="ml-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold">Temperature Integrity</h4>
                                    <p class="text-text-secondary">Frozen items must remain at controlled temperatures. Once thawed, the texture, flavor, and safety can be affected. Returned products may not meet our strict quality standards.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-brown flex-shrink-0 mt-1"></i>
                                <div class="ml-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold">Food Safety & Hygiene</h4>
                                    <p class="text-text-secondary">Reaccepting opened or thawed products poses a risk of contamination. Protecting our customers from potential foodborne illness is always our top priority.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                             <div class="flex items-start">
                                <i data-lucide="archive" class="w-10 h-10 text-accent-brown flex-shrink-0 mt-1"></i>
                                <div class="ml-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold">Shelf Life & Inventory</h4>
                                    <p class="text-text-secondary">Frozen foods have a limited freshness window. Allowing returns could disrupt safe inventory management and lead to unnecessary product waste.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mt-12 bg-accent-brown/10 p-8 rounded-lg" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-4">What We Can Do Instead</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">
                            While we can’t accept returns, we’re always here to help if something isn’t right. Please reach out to our <a href="./contact.html" class="font-semibold text-accent-brown hover:underline">customer support team</a> if you face any issues. Depending on the situation, we may offer:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-text-secondary">
                            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Product Replacement:</span> If your order arrives damaged, defective, or does not meet our quality promise, we’ll arrange a suitable replacement.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Customer Assistance:</span> Our team is available to guide you with preparation, storage, or any concerns related to your purchase.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                         <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-4">Our Promise</h3>
                         <p class="text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">We know that every bite matters. That’s why we handle each order with care, ensuring your food is delivered in the best condition possible. Thank you for trusting Nanshhuf to bring safe, fresh, and flavorful frozen delights to your table.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

<%- include('partials/footer') -%>
<script>
    if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined') {
        lucide.createIcons();
    }
</script>
